node_modules
.git
**/node_modules
**/.gitignore
**/*.md
**/dist
**/out
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.development.local
**/.env.test.local
**/.env.production.local
# `websites/portfolio` used to be excluded outright, which is the reason
# portfolio could not join the container harness: the image did not contain it.
# Its runtime trees are excluded instead, exactly as recipe's are — and note
# .env.local stays excluded above, which is why the container needs AUTH_SECRET
# injected at `docker run`.
websites/resume-builder
websites/recipe-website/*/content
websites/recipe-website/*/test-content
websites/recipe-website/*/test-settings
websites/portfolio/*/content
websites/portfolio/*/test-content
websites/portfolio/*/test-settings
# The demo's runtime tree, excluded for the same reasons as the sites' above.
# It is gitignored scratch that `resetData` deletes and recreates on the
# suite's first test, so baking a developer's local copy in is pure waste — and
# because it changes on every local run it would invalidate the `COPY . .`
# layer every time, rebuilding the image from scratch.
packages/cms/demo/test-content
**/.cypress
